{"abstract":"Digital twins make use of numerous models during to design, deployment, operations and maintain Cyber-Physical systems and have received significant uptake in industry and academia. However, the engineering of digital twins themselves is a difficult task that has attracted more attention in the last years. This short paper introduces the ISoLA 2024 series of papers on the engineering of digital twins, with a focus on the connection to data-driven approaches, interoperability and adaptation to changes at runtime.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Fitzgerald, John","Gomes, Cláudio","Johnsen, Einar Broch","Kamburjan, Eduard","Leucker, Martin","Woodcock, Jim"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-807092"],"event":{"end":"2024-10-31","place":"Crete, gr","start":"2024-10-27","title":"12th International Symposium on Leveraging Applications of Formal Methods, Verification and Validation, ISoLA 2024","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Leucker, Martin"],"country":["Germany","Norway","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Newcastle University","University of Lübeck","University of Oslo","University of York"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"digital twin engineering","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/105003242244","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-807092","identifier":[{"id":"105003242244","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-9acf0df7-0ba5-4501-8d2a-69d655f69af7"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-EF1F676C78EB691F3FDC7CB4870E50A2"],"org":[