{"abstract":"The proceedings contain 6 papers. The topics discussed include: leveraging runtime verification for the monitoring of digital twins; emerging challenges in compositionality and correctness for digital twins; are formal contracts a useful digital twin of software systems?; digital twin for rescue missions – a case study; a digital twin for coupling mobility and energy optimization: the ReNuBiL living lab; and mining digital twins of a VPN server.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Hallerstede, Stefan","Kamburjan, Eduard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-708555"],"event":{"end":"2023-03-06","place":"Lubeck, de","start":"2023-03-06","title":"2023 Workshop on Applications of Formal Methods and Digital Twins, FMDT 2023","year":"2023"},"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Oslo"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"proceedings of the workshop on applications of formal methods and digital twins co located with 000000000025th international symposium on formal methods fm 000000002023","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://ceur-ws.org/Vol-3507/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-708555","identifier":[{"id":"85175971286","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-93824918-feaf-4f2e-82ab-b426fa915f00"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2C95AACB6753B095CA0B50F27C573CAB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://ceur-ws.org/Vol-3507/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Uni